+lines=['# 01-destroy-artifact-land','','Shape: One-shot sorcery destroying exactly one artifact or land, with only a supported rider (regeneration prevention, controller life loss, or cycling).','','## Source and identity','','| Card | Oracle ID | Cost | Type | Oracle text |','|---|---|---|---|---|']
